# Pride landing (`/pride`) — claim-only lock

Owner brand lock for the live Pride promotion. **Do not reintroduce an Offer conditions block on the face.**

## Face (claim-only)

Keep only:

- Full-bleed owner Pride parade photo (`/images/menrush/21-pride-parade-flags.jpeg`) with dark night/copper wash (photo slightly transparent under the claim). Do not crop faces off when possible. Do not add extra logos or flag graphics.
- Official bronze medallion (`BrandMark` → menrush-logo / medallion only). Do not redraw MENRUSH as type.
- Overline: `PRIDE PROMOTION · UK`
- Headline: `3 months Premium from launch`
- One gold **Claim Pride code** button (opens email + 18+ confirm form). Never **Resend my Pride code** on this face — claim framing stays after the issue window closes.
- Form-adjacent: submitting the form sends the invite. It is not the grant. Enter the code at register. You cannot use Premium before launch.
- One quiet line: **Terms and conditions apply.** linked to `/terms`

## Forbidden on `/pride`

- Offer conditions heading, numbered list, or grant-rule bullets
- Public printed-code CTA / quiet `PRIDE 3MONTH FREE` redeem line on the face (redeem still works at register; detail lives in Terms)
- The word **Brighton** (face, email preview, or e2e that render this page)
- City-launch lists (London / Birmingham / Manchester / Brighton)
- Path 2 cards, Free app essay, second gold CTA
- Em dash / en dash in new copy (write `21 to 31 August`, not `21–31`)

## Grant rules live in Terms (clause 7.7)

Honest Pride grant rules belong in `Terms.tsx` §7.7, not on the face. Include: new invites 21 to 31 August 2026 only; printed PRIDE 3MONTH FREE by 5 September 2026; personal earlier-email codes by 31 October 2026; 3 months Premium from launch; one grant; no stacking; replaces 7.2 waitlist gift; 18+; UK-first; not billed; not a sponsor of Southampton Pride or Manchester Village Pride; duration from launch (on-time 1 Oct 2026 ends 1 Jan 2027; slip = 3 months from actual open).

## Look

Night `#0D0A06`, copper `#C4832A`, cream `#F0E0C0`, official logo unmodified. Claim face over washed parade photo. No brochure layout.

## Behaviour (do not change)

Register still accepts personal `PRIDE-XXXX-XXXX` by 31 October 2026 and printed `PRIDE 3MONTH FREE` by 5 September 2026. Claim form (behind Claim Pride code), clocks, payment, adult-assurance stay as shipped. Do not print `PRIDE 3MONTH FREE` on the face.

